            "EC-AF-009"
          ],
          "step_number": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Diverges from main flow step 1: Instead of first accessing 'My Current Bids', the Customer may access the 'My Watch List' page via the 'My Watch List' link in the global site header or the vanity URL www.jtvauctions.com/mywatchlist. The page displays a table sorted by ending time with columns for Item #, Description, Auction Number, Current High Bid, Total Bids, Last Bid Time, Ending Time, and an Action column containing a 'Bid' button.",
