            "EC-AF-014"
          ],
          "step_number": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "Diverges from main flow step 1: Instead of first accessing 'My Current Bids', the Customer may navigate directly to the 'My Bid History' page to monitor past auction status.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EC-AF-001"
          ],
          "step_number": 3
        },
        {
          "content": "Diverges from main flow step 4: Instead of accessing 'My Bid History', the Customer may follow the 'Recently Ended Auctions' link from the 'My Current Bids' page (or other pages) to view past auction status. This page displays a table sorted by ending time showing Item #, Description, Auction Number, Winning Amount, Winner, and Ending Time, and shows 24 hours worth of history.",
